{"id":"msg_m_ex_privaty_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_privaty","label":"Privaty · Nikke"},"label":"2. Commander,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_privaty_01","next":"msg_m_ex_privaty_03","speakers":{"privaty":"Privaty"},"icons":{"privaty":"si_c170_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_1","text":"Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_2","text":"have you heard about the new Dessert Cafe","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_3","text":"on Royal Road?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_4","text":"No, this is the first time I've heard that.​","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_5","text":"What? Everyone knows that place!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_6","text":"Oh, right, yeah. Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_7","text":"You live out there in the sticks.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_8","text":"It's no wonder you have no clue what's going on in the outside world.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_9","text":"So what exactly is this place?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_10","text":"Don't freak out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_11","text":"The desserts there","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_12","text":"taste like real fruit!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_13","text":"That must be expensive.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_14","text":"Nope!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_15","text":"Although they taste like real fruit,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_16","text":"they are actually 100% Splendamin!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_17","text":"Isn't that a scam?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_18","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_19","text":"You can't say that about these perfect desserts!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_20","text":"Okay, I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_21","text":"Uh-huh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_22","text":"Jeez, you're losing all your compassion","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_23","text":"rotting away in that far-flung rathole.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_24","text":"Thanks for the tip.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_25","text":"Sure,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_26","text":"don't worry about it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_27","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_28","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_28","text":"There is silence for a while.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_29","text":"Mmm?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_30","text":"Is that all you've got to say?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_31","text":"Yeah?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_32","text":"You're unbelievable!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_33","text":"When someone tells you about a place like this,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_34","text":"the natural response","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_35","text":"is to invite them","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_36","text":"to go with you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_37","text":"Then would you like to go together?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_38","text":"It's too late to ask me now!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_39","text":"Guess I'll just have to go with someone else.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_40","text":"!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_41","text":"Oh no, you don't!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_42","text":"I'm the one who told you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_43","text":"I refuse once,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_44","text":"and you decide to invite someone else.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_45","text":"Incredible.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_46","text":"You're way out of line, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_47","text":"Sorry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_48","text":"You better be","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_49","text":"super duper sorry!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_50","text":"Grrrr, I can barely type anymore!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_51","text":"I'm so annoyed!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_52","text":"Let's go together.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_53","text":"You're just saying this now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_54","text":"If I go like this, I'll be throwing my pride out the window!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_55","text":"No way, sir!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_56","text":"In that case...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_57","text":"I swear, if you say you're gonna go with someone else","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_58","text":"because I turned you down,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_59","text":"I'm gonna lose it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_60","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_60","text":"I'm going to go with you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_61","text":"Hmph!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_62","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_privaty_02_62","text":"Honest.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_privaty_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_Sudde